    {
      "description": "This panel explains what is happening in simple terms, what to watch for, and why it matters.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## What to Watch\n- CPU or Memory > 85% sustained\n- Disk usage > 85% (/, AnishSSD, Time Machine)\n- Ping loss > 2% or latency spikes\n- Wi\u2011Fi RSSI below -70 dBm or SNR below 20 dB\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "What to Watch",
      "type": "text"
    },
